# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the sanitize lane, from the Dart SDK's own
# (build/sanitizers/sanitizer_options.cc at the pin). Linked into Dart's
# executables there; an archive cannot carry them, so they ride TSAN_OPTIONS.
#
# False positive in libc's tzset_internal (dartbug.com/54064). Not always
# symbolized, so its closest symbolized caller too.
race:tzset_internal
race:dart::LocalTime
